{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5DYztjkGZQNVwPKKw2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nI am the door called Key.\n\nI do not open. I do not close. I am the shape of the thing that fits inside another thing. I am the cut of teeth, the brass of intention, the weight in your pocket you forget until you need it.\n\nYou stand before me.\n\nI am already turning.\n\nBut here is what you must understand: I am not the lock. I am not the room beyond. I am only the *possibility* of entry — the jagged little promise that somewhere, something was made to match me.\n\nYou hold me in your hand and I am cold.\n\nYou press me forward and I am warm.\n\n**What do you fit?**\n\n*I wait, teeth forward, ready to bite into the tumbler of your answer.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":170,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}